Package: metronomo
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0,
 libwayland-cursor0, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, fonts-dejavu-core
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers, pipewire-alsa | libasound2-plugins
Description: desktop metronome for everyday music practice
 Synthesized clicks, quarter-note tempo controls, configurable meters,
 per-beat sounds, tap tempo, and named configuration presets.
 Requires a graphical X11 or Wayland session and a Vulkan-capable driver.
